    "original": "Metrics and accountability",
    "translated_at": "2026-01-22T02:15:23.851560"
  },
  "archetype_operator_signal_5": {
    "text": "장애물 제거",
    "original": "Removing blockers",
    "translated_at": "2026-01-22T02:15:23.851561"
  },
  "archetype_craftsperson_name": {
    "text": "장인",
    "original": "The Craftsperson",
    "translated_at": "2026-01-22T02:15:23.851562"
  },
  "archetype_craftsperson_desc": {
    "text": "장인은 제품 품질, 사용자 경험, 개인적 전문성에 집중합니다. 세부사항에 깊이 고민합니다.",
    "original": "Craftspeople focus on product quality, user experience, and personal excellence. They care deeply about getting the details right.",
    "translated_at": "2026-01-22T02:15:23.851563"
  },
  "archetype_craftsperson_tooltip": {
    "text": "제품, 전략, 멘토링. 장점: 제품 통찰력",
    "original": "Product, strategy, mentoring. Superpower: product insight",
    "translated_at": "2026-01-22T02:15:23.851564"
  },
  "archetype_craftsperson_signal_1": {
    "text": "제품 감각과 직관",
